OL,3,CWhitney Houston honoured with new
OL,4,CBarbie doll
OL,6,FBarbie has honoured the late Whitney
OL,7,FHouston with her very own doll.
OL,9,FShe joins a number of stars, including
OL,10,FDavid Bowie and Diana Ross, who have
OL,11,Fbeen honoured with a doll as part of
OL,12,Fthe Barbie Signature Series.
OL,14,FThe doll replicates her look from her
OL,15,FI Wanna Dance With Somebody (Who Loves
OL,16,FMe) music video, featuring a pink
OL,17,Fbodycon midi dress, colourful earrings
OL,18,Fand white and blue heels, completed
OL,19,Fwith her signature '80s fringe and
OL,20,Flong curly hair.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
