OL,3,CWhitney Houston honoured with new
OL,4,CBarbie doll
OL,6,FMarking nearly four decades since the
OL,7,Ftrack was first released, and also her
OL,8,Fbirthday, the doll honours the singer
OL,9,Fand her legacy in music, entertainment
OL,10,Fand culture.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FNathan Baynard, vice president and
OL,18,Fhead of Barbie at Mattel said:
OL,19,F"Whitney Houston's music has been the
OL,20,Fsoundtrack to countless moments for
OL,21,Ffans around the world.
