PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786322871
OL,3,CWhitney Houston honoured with new
OL,4,CBarbie doll
OL,6,F"Barbie is proud to honour her
OL,7,Fextraordinary legacy with the latest
OL,8,Faddition to the Barbie Signature
OL,9,FSeries.
OL,11,F"This doll celebrates her unmistakable
OL,12,Fstyle, joy and spirit. We hope it
OL,13,Fgives fans a meaningful way to
OL,14,Fcelebrate the artist whose voice and
OL,15,Finfluence continue to resonate around
OL,16,Fthe world."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@KO]
