OL,3,CWhitney Houston honoured with new
OL,4,CBarbie doll
OL,6,FThe doll was unveiled during the 5th
OL,7,Fannual Whitney Houston Legacy of Love
OL,8,Fgala, which is held to benefit the
OL,9,Flate singer's foundation aimed at
OL,10,Fhelping young people.
OL,12,FShe joins a string of musicians
OL,13,Fincluding Miley Cyrus, Kylie Minogue,
OL,14,FStevie Nicks and Gloria Estefan who
OL,15,Fhave all been honoured in the Barbie
OL,16,FSignature Series.
OL,18,FOther stars include Tina Turner, Elvis
OL,19,FPresley, Sir Elton John and Juan
OL,20,FGabriel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
