OL,3,CWhitney Houston honoured with new
OL,4,CBarbie doll
OL,6,FHouston became one of the top-selling
OL,7,Fartists in pop history after she was
OL,8,Fsigned as a teenager.
OL,10,FShe was behind hits including How Will
OL,11,FI Know, Saving All My Love For You and
OL,12,Fher chart topping rendition of I Will
OL,13,FAlways Love You.
OL,15,FShe died in 2012 aged 48.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
